<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Acceleration and displacement from velocity</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>A boda boda rides along a straight road through a junction \(J\). Take its direction of travel as positive. Its velocity at time \(t\) seconds is \(v = {@vt@}\) m/s, for \(0 \le t \le {@T2@}\). When \(t = 0\) its displacement from \(J\) is \({@s0@}\) m[[if test="is(s0<0)"]] (negative: it has not yet reached \(J\))[[else]] (it has already passed \(J\))[[/if]]. Give exact values.</p><p>(a) Find its acceleration when \(t = {@T1@}\).</p><div>\(a =\) [[input:ans1]] m/s\(^2\) [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find its displacement from its starting point at \(t = {@T2@}\), that is, how far it moves between \(t = 0\) and \(t = {@T2@}\).</p><div>Displacement \(=\) [[input:ans2]] m [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div><p>(c) Find its displacement from \(J\) when \(t = {@T2@}\).</p><div>\(s =\) [[input:ans3]] m [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Differentiate the velocity to find the acceleration; integrate it to find the displacement.</p><p>(a) \(a = \dfrac{dv}{dt} = {@diff(vt,t)@}\), so at \(t = {@T1@}\), \(a = {@aT1@}\) m/s\(^2\).</p><p>(b) \(\displaystyle\int_0^{ {@T2@} } \left({@vt@}\right)dt = \left[{@integrate(vt,t)@}\right]_0^{ {@T2@} } = {@Dv@}\) m. The velocity is positive throughout, so the boda boda moves the same way all the time.</p><p>(c) Its displacement from \(J\) at the start was \({@s0@}\) m, so at \(t = {@T2@}\) it is \({@s0@} + {@Dv@} = {@pos@}\) m[[if test="is(s0<0)"]]: it is now \({@pos@}\) m past \(J\)[[/if]].</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[/* Design: [p, q, r, T1, T2, s0]: v = p t^2 + q t + r on [0, T2]. Keep the boda boda context realistic: v between 3 and 16 m/s, |a| at most 3 m/s^2, s0 negative (before J) on 5 entries and positive on 5. Source: original. */
L: [[-3/10,3,8,3,5,-20],[-1/4,1,7,4,6,-30],[-1/4,3,7,1,6,15],[-1/2,3,3,5,6,-10],[-3/10,3,5,4,10,-40],[3/10,-1,5,3,5,12],[1/4,-1,11,3,6,-25],[1/4,-1,7,5,6,8],[3/10,-1,7,4,5,-15],[-3/10,1,6,3,5,20]];
ix: 1+rand(10);
pp: L[ix][1]; qq: L[ix][2]; rr: L[ix][3]; T1: L[ix][4]; T2: L[ix][5]; s0: L[ix][6];
vt: pp*t^2+qq*t+rr;
aT1: subst(t=T1, diff(vt,t));
Dv: ev(integrate(vt, t, 0, T2));
pos: s0+Dv;
/* diagnostics */
vT1: subst(t=T1, vt);
vtimes: subst(t=T2, vt)*T2;
msign: Dv-s0;]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
